    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every family has a story. Your family "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "history",
            "ref": "v-history"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is the story of the people who came "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " you—your parents, grandparents, and even "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "great-grandparents",
            "zh": "曾祖父母"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Learning about them helps you know more about who you are."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You can start by "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to your family. Ask your mum, dad, or grandparents what life was like when they were young. You can also look at old photos together. Ask, “Who is in this picture?” or “What were you doing that day?” Photos help you "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "remember",
            "ref": "v-remember"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " happy times and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " new stories."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Next, you can make a family "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Write your name, your parents’ names, and your grandparents’ names. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Add",
            "ref": "v-add"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " pictures if you have them!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You can also make a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "memory",
            "ref": "v-memory"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " box or a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scrapbook",
            "zh": "剪贴簿"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Put in photos, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", or stories about your family. One day, you can "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "share",
            "ref": "v-share"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it with "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "younger",
            "zh": "更年轻的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " family members so they can learn your family story too."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
